repository-code: 'https://github.com/edanya-uma/HySEALab'
url: 'https://edanya.uma.es/hysea/'
abstract: >-
  HySEALab is a collection of Jupyter Notebooks designed to
  assist researchers in preprocessing, processing, and
  postprocessing tasks for the HySEA family of simulation
  codes. The notebooks cover activities including
  bathymetric and topographic data preparation, mesh
  generation, simulation setup and execution, and analysis
  and visualization of results.
